s when there are less than 10 tanks at a site.\n\nPrevious E version updates included in this release: Mac and Location info to show in emails, Blue box on dashboard is not hidden when more than 10 tanks are viewed, Login page auto refresh bug fix and Sync db to oilcopsupport.com issue fixes. Mobile Login Page redirection issue fixes. If not exist removed as DB version is not supporting','global','E',0,1,1668083605,'V1'),(242,'version_8v4n1y','LQD_T_2_81','New fix in this release: On view more tanks page clicking on the tanks brings up the managers adjust inventory page as it does when there are less than 10 tanks at a site. \n\nPrevious E version updates included in this release: Mac and Location info to show in emails, Blue box on dashboard is not hidden when more than 10 tanks are viewed, Login page auto refresh bug fix and Sync db to oilcopsupport.com issue fixes. Mobile Login Page redirection issue fixes. If not exist removed as DB version is not supporting','global','T',0,1,1668083726,'V1'),(243,'version_5swpwl','LQD_E_2_90','New in this version:  Filcar smtp setting ssl and tls fields are both updated when DB changes are done:  Also include previous fixes: On view more tanks page clicking on the tanks brings up the managers adjust inventory page as it does when there are less than 10 tanks at a site. Mac and Location info to show in emails, Blue box on dashboard is not hidden when more than 10 tanks are viewed, Login page auto refresh bug fix and Sync db to oilcopsupport.com issue fixes. Mobile Login Page redirection issue fixes. If not exist removed as DB version is not supporting. Add admin option to all users to set dashboard refresh frequency and contains revert back to old Gartec email server, reel not found fix, login page footer addition, WO search feature addition,','global','E',0,1,1670250678,'V1'),(244,'version_ra75e4','LQD_T_2_82','New in this version: Filcar smtp setting ssl and tls fields are both updated when DB changes are done: Also include previous fixes: On view more tanks page clicking on the tanks brings up the managers adjust inventory page as it does when there are less than 10 tanks at a site. Mac and Location info to show in emails, Blue box on dashboard is not hidden when more than 10 tanks are viewed, Login page auto refresh bug fix and Sync db to oilcopsupport.com issue fixes. Mobile Login Page redirection issue fixes. If not exist removed as DB version is not supporting. Add admin option to all users to set dashboard refresh frequency and contains revert back to old Gartec email server, reel not found fix, login page footer addition, WO search feature addition,','global','T',0,1,1670250772,'V1'),(245,'version_zxza9j','LQD_R_2_39','From test version T_82:  Filcar smtp setting ssl and tls fields are both updated when DB changes are done: On view more tanks page clicking on the tanks brings up the managers adjust inventory page as it does when there are less than 10 tanks at a site. Mac and Location info to show in emails, Blue box on dashboard is not hidden when more than 10 tanks are viewed, Login page auto refresh bug fix and Sync db to oilcopsupport.com issue fixes. Mobile Login Page redirection issue fixes. If not exist removed as DB version is not supporting. Add admin option to all users to set dashboard refresh frequency and contains revert back to old Gartec email server, reel not found fix, login page footer addition, WO search feature addition,','global','R',0,1,1670352394,'V1'),(246,'version_wr6pxr','LQD_E_2_91','When TMM readings are invalid due loss of communication the systems that report to oilcopsupport.com will flag the users that the data shown is invalid.','global','E',0,1,1672936258,'V1'),(247,'version_79p3kp','LQD_EV2_2_2','Included in this release, initial setup DB updated, protocol bugs fixed, dropdowns listing order alphabetic, Station config and Admin options UI updates, extra fields added to synchronized db, station config session and column fixes.','global','E',0,1,16